**Title: Whispering Waves and Starlit Dreams**

**Description:**  
Join young Finn and his playful otter companion, Ripple, on a serene journey along a tranquil coastal shoreline. As the sun sets and the horizon turns to twilight, Finn experiences a deep connection with nature. The rhythmic lull of the sea and the gentle touch of the evening breeze provide a soothing backdrop for this enchanting tale. Finn's exploration of the shifting sands and whispering waves is a poetic reminder of the simple joys found in nature. This gentle story, crafted to reduce anxiety and foster emotional calm, encourages listeners to drift into a peaceful sleep, feeling the profound connection to the world around them.

